      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "It is with great pleasure that we introduce this very nicely appointed 'own door' two-bedroom ground floor apartment, quietly positioned at the end of a terrace within the popular Seville Lawns development.\r\n\r\nBuilt circa 2006, No. 56 enjoys a peaceful setting with minimal passing traffic, together with the benefit of its gable-end position. This allows for a large bay window in the kitchen/dining room, bringing an abundance of natural daylight to a room where most apartments have no kitchen window.\r\n\r\nThe property has recently been upgraded with a brand-new fitted kitchen, while the accommodation extends to approximately 69 sq. m. and includes two bedrooms, ensuite, living room, kitchen/dining room and main bathroom.\r\n\r\nOutside, there is a private car parking space immediately to the front, an enclosed private rear patio and access to a large gated communal garden, for residents to enjoy.\r\n\r\nThe location is particularly convenient, just beyond Kilkenny City's ring road on the Callan / Clonmel / Cork Road, with easy access to routes out of the city and Kilkenny city centre within walking distance. A petrol station with convenience store, neighbourhood pub and Hotel Kilkenny & Leisure Centre are also nearby.\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION\r\nENTRANCE HALL\r\nWooden flooring.\r\nLIVING ROOM\r\nWooden flooring, front window and attractive gas fireplace with hearth, insert and surround.\r\nKITCHEN / DINING ROOM\r\nBright and spacious room with large gable-end bay window. Tiled floor and brand-new fitted kitchen with excellent storage, tiled splashback, fitted electric hob and oven, recesses for washing machine, dryer and fridge freezer.\r\nREAR HALL\r\nWooden flooring.\r\nBATHROOM\r\nFully tiled, with WC, WHB, bath with electric shower overhead, radiator and extractor fan.\r\nBEDROOM 1\r\nWooden flooring with double glass doors to the enclosed rear patio.\r\nENSUITE\r\nFully tiled, with WC, WHB and shower cubicle with mains shower.\r\nBEDROOM 2\r\nWooden flooring with window overlooking the rear patio.\r\nEXTERIOR\r\nQuiet end-of-terrace position with minimal passing traffic. Enclosed private rear patio with gate to the large gated communal gardens. Private car parking space immediately to the front.\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES\r\n•\tQuiet end-of-terrace position\r\n•\tLarge gable-end bay window to kitchen/dining room\r\n•\tBrand-new fitted kitchen\r\n•\tc. 69 sq. m. two-bedroom ground floor apartment\r\n•\tPrincipal bedroom with ensuite\r\n•\tPrivate rear patio\r\n•\tAccess to large gated communal gardens\r\n•\tPrivate car parking space\r\n•\tC2 BER\r\n•\tWalking distance to Kilkenny city centre\r\n•\tConvenient Callan / Clonmel / Cork Road location\r\n•\tHotel Kilkenny & Leisure Centre and local amenities nearby\r\n\r\nBER: C2 | BER No.: 115443319\r\nManagement Fee: €1,300.00 p.a. if paid upon receipt. \r\nServices: Gas fired central heating, electricity, mains water and sewerage, telephone, TV & broadband. \r\nInclusions: Fixtures and fittings.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended. Please call Warren McCreery on (056) 770 2000 or (086) 856 2044.\r\n\r\nThese particulars are issued strictly on the understanding that they do not form part of any contract and are provided, without liability, as a general guide only to what is being offered subject to contract and availability. They are not to be construed as containing any representation of fact upon which any interested party is entitled to rely. Any intending purchaser or lessee should satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the accuracy of these particulars. The vendor or lessor do not make, give or imply nor is Warren McCreery or its staff authorized to make, give or imply any representation or warranty whatsoever in respect of this property. No responsibility can be accepted for any expenses incurred by intending purchasers in inspecting properties which have been sold let or withdrawn."
